{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>A SUPER UPER DUPER VERY SIMPLE DEFINITELY EASY casual-friendly Sokoban puzzle.\u00a0</strong></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u00a0(NO, THEY ARE NOT EASY)</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Please help send these Goofy\u00a0Gums home... They're sticky and they really need your help...</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Sokoban Charm:</strong> Push blocks, solve puzzles, and relive the timeless fun of classic Sokoban gameplay with a sticky twist!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All Gums Move Together:</strong> Every Gum moves at the same time, whether you're ready or not! Precision? Coordination? Chaos? Yes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stick to Literally Everything:</strong> Walls, blocks, corners. These Gums are <i>so</i> sticky, it's almost a problem (but that's kinda the whole point).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push It, Then Stick It:</strong> You can shove stones like a Sokoban pro, but don\u2019t get too close... You might just glue yourself to them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many more to come... (in development)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4105470?t=1761940274","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4105470?t=1761940274","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105470/fc5d45431b3a03d830712d2f955e4cfa213bcce4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761940274","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105470/fc5d45431b3a03d830712d2f955e4cfa213bcce4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761940274","categories":[{"descrip